  "editNote": "Skill qualifier added from the book: page 76 prints \"Crafting +7 (+14 for firearms)\"; the source omits the parenthesis, and there is no errata for the book. Hand cannon corrected: page 77 prints its traits separated by semicolons, \"modular B, P, or S; range increment 30 feet; reload 1\", and the source split them at the commas. The Strike is modular between bludgeoning, piercing and slashing, with a range increment of 30 feet and reload 1. Its damage, which page 77 prints \"1d6+3 modular\", is 1d6+3 of the type the modular trait chooses: bludgeoning, piercing or slashing."
